{"sections":{"perito_hero_JxTUht":{"type":"perito-hero","name":"Perito Hero","settings":{"eyebrow":"ARTISAN PERFUMERY","heading":"Scent as an Art Form","description":"Each fragrance is a meditation on place, memory, and emotion — crafted in small batches from rare ingredients, bottled with intention.","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Untitled_design_-_2026-03-31T122124.217.png","image_fit":"cover","primary_button_label":"SHOP COLLECTION","primary_button_link":"shopify:\/\/collections","secondary_button_label":"EXPLORE SAMPLES","secondary_button_link":"","container_width":1440,"hero_height":410,"padding_top":22,"padding_bottom":38,"padding_x":72,"content_column_width":360,"content_max_width":320,"column_gap":80,"image_width":455,"image_height":460,"eyebrow_font_size":14,"eyebrow_margin_bottom":18,"eyebrow_letter_spacing":0.3,"eyebrow_line_height":1,"eyebrow_font_weight":400,"heading_font_size":54,"heading_line_height":1.2,"heading_letter_spacing":0,"heading_font_weight":450,"heading_max_width":260,"desc_font_size":16,"desc_line_height":1.8,"desc_letter_spacing":0,"desc_font_weight":400,"desc_margin_top":18,"desc_max_width":250,"buttons_margin_top":30,"button_gap":10,"button_min_width":102,"button_height":28,"button_padding_x":16,"button_font_size":11,"button_letter_spacing":0.2,"button_font_weight":400,"mobile_padding_top":28,"mobile_padding_bottom":42,"mobile_padding_x":20,"mobile_row_gap":30,"mobile_image_width":320,"mobile_image_height":345,"mobile_eyebrow_font_size":9,"mobile_heading_font_size":34,"mobile_desc_font_size":12,"mobile_button_min_width":120,"mobile_button_height":36,"mobile_button_font_size":8,"section_bg":"#283416","text_color":"#fff9e1","eyebrow_color":"#ffffff","heading_color":"#ffffff","desc_color":"#bfc5b0","image_bg":"#c9dbef","primary_button_bg":"#fff9e1","primary_button_text":"#273315","secondary_button_text":"#fff9e1","secondary_button_border":"#8b9577"}},"perito_philosophy_FdVF3Y":{"type":"perito-philosophy","name":"Perito Philosophy","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/92A91A56-DED5-4DEB-991E-75390EBCB5F0.jpg","eyebrow":"","heading":"Perfumery as Poetry","lead":"At Artisan Dixit, perfume is not treated as a product. It is treated as atmosphere, memory, obsession, and craftsmanship distilled into liquid form. Every creation begins with raw materials chosen not for marketing value, but for emotional impact. Rare woods, florals, resins, tinctures, and molecules are layered with precision to create fragrances that feel deeply personal and unmistakably alive.\n\nThe philosophy is simple. Precision before poetry.\n\nNo trend chasing. No imitation. No unnecessary excess. Only the pursuit of originality through patience, artistic freedom, and an uncompromising respect for perfumery as an art form. Each perfume is built to evoke emotion quietly yet powerfully, leaving behind not just a scent, but a presence.\n\nArtisan Dixit stands for modern Indian artisanal perfumery with a global soul. Timeless compositions crafted for those who value depth, character, and understated luxury.","body":"","quote":"“Perfumery was never meant to smell safe, predictable, or algorithmically beautiful. The moment fragrance became more about marketing decks than emotion, the soul quietly left the bottle.”","quote_author":"— Artisan Dixit","image_fit":"cover","padding_top":64,"padding_bottom":64,"content_width":470,"image_width":490,"image_height":630,"column_gap":96,"content_offset_top":28,"eyebrow_font_size":14,"eyebrow_line_height":1.2,"eyebrow_letter_spacing":0.3,"eyebrow_font_weight":400,"eyebrow_margin_bottom":18,"heading_font_size":40,"heading_line_height":1.2,"heading_letter_spacing":0,"heading_font_weight":500,"lead_margin_top":28,"lead_font_size":16,"lead_line_height":1.8,"lead_letter_spacing":0,"lead_font_weight":400,"body_margin_top":40,"paragraph_gap":18,"body_font_size":16,"body_line_height":1.8,"body_letter_spacing":0,"body_font_weight":400,"quote_margin_top":42,"quote_padding_top":28,"quote_font_size":18,"quote_line_height":1.7,"quote_letter_spacing":0,"quote_font_weight":400,"quote_author_margin_top":14,"quote_author_font_size":12,"quote_author_line_height":1.3,"quote_author_letter_spacing":0.1,"quote_author_font_weight":400,"mobile_padding_top":36,"mobile_padding_bottom":36,"mobile_row_gap":32,"mobile_image_height":360,"mobile_heading_font_size":30,"mobile_lead_font_size":12,"mobile_body_font_size":12,"section_bg":"#283416","text_color":"#efe9d8","eyebrow_color":"#9ca688","heading_color":"#f4efe2","lead_color":"#cdd2c2","body_color":"#bec6b4","quote_color":"#efe9d8","quote_author_color":"#aeb7a0","divider_color":"#66714e","image_bg":"#d9d9d9"}},"perito_bespoke_JycirH":{"type":"perito-bespoke","blocks":{"step_4N9gHr":{"type":"step","disabled":true,"settings":{"icon":"mail","number":"01","title":"Initial Consultation","text":"Share your vision, memories, and scent preferences through an in-depth conversation."}},"step_H7AJWb":{"type":"step","disabled":true,"settings":{"icon":"palette","number":"02","title":"Bespoke Composition","text":"Our perfumer creates a unique formula tailored exclusively to your story and desires."}},"step_MTyDPP":{"type":"step","disabled":true,"settings":{"icon":"sparkle","number":"03","title":"Refinement Sessions","text":"We refine the fragrance together through multiple iterations until perfection."}},"step_hLmXrD":{"type":"step","disabled":true,"settings":{"icon":"clock","number":"04","title":"Final Creation","text":"Your signature scent is crafted, bottled, and presented in a bespoke vessel."}}},"block_order":["step_4N9gHr","step_H7AJWb","step_MTyDPP","step_hLmXrD"],"name":"Perito Bespoke Service","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/IMG_3201.jpg","eyebrow":"","heading":"OUR STUDIO","description":"Hidden away in Pune exists the quiet heart of Artisan Dixit. A private perfumery studio where ideas slowly turn into emotion through scent. Part laboratory and part artist’s sanctuary, this is where months disappear in pursuit of a single perfect accord. Rare oud oils rest beside experimental tinctures, florals, smoke, woods, fossilized resins, and forgotten materials waiting to become something timeless.\n\nThe studio does not function like a factory. It moves with patience, instinct, and obsession. Every perfume begins here with research, raw material studies, endless modifications, and an uncompromising pursuit of depth. Long nights of blending. Coffee stained notebooks. Silence filled with sandalwood, tobacco, florals, and aging oils.\n\nThis is not a place built for mass production. It is built for creation. Quietly and obsessively. One bottle at a time.","journey_title":"","investment_eyebrow":"","price":"","investment_text":"","button_label":"","button_link":"","limited_text":"","image_fit":"cover","padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0,"intro_width":760,"intro_margin_bottom":48,"image_height":460,"image_margin_bottom":40,"steps_gap":30,"steps_margin_bottom":30,"steps_bottom_space":50,"investment_margin_top":40,"investment_width":460,"eyebrow_font_size":14,"eyebrow_letter_spacing":0.4,"eyebrow_font_weight":400,"eyebrow_margin_bottom":20,"heading_font_size":50,"heading_line_height":1.2,"heading_font_weight":500,"description_margin_top":42,"description_width":780,"description_font_size":18,"description_line_height":1.9,"description_font_weight":400,"journey_title_size":28,"journey_title_weight":500,"icon_size":50,"icon_margin_bottom":24,"step_number_size":40,"step_number_weight":300,"step_number_margin_bottom":22,"step_title_size":20,"step_title_weight":600,"step_title_margin_bottom":16,"step_text_size":14,"step_text_line_height":1.8,"step_text_weight":400,"price_size":42,"price_weight":300,"investment_text_margin_top":18,"investment_text_width":620,"investment_text_size":16,"investment_text_line_height":1.7,"button_width":290,"button_height":54,"button_margin_top":36,"button_font_size":14,"button_letter_spacing":0.1,"button_font_weight":400,"limited_margin_top":32,"limited_size":14,"mobile_paddi